# Ep LF cho dataset manifest (dap CA Review 2 F-A12-02 / Manifest v3 Preparation Directive).
#
# Ly do: `core.autocrlf=true` la mac dinh Git for Windows, nen checkout tren Windows doi LF -> CRLF.
# Voi manifest, dieu do lam SHA-256 khac nhau giua may Dev (Windows) va VPS (Linux) du NOI DUNG
# GIONG HET — da chung minh byte-level tren v2: bo CR khoi ban Windows thi `cmp` bao identical va
# hash ra dung `5f0f92db...` cua VPS (chenh lech dung 225 byte = 225 dong x 1 byte CR).
#
# CA yeu cau manifest v3 phai co MOT canonical Linux/VPS SHA-256 duy nhat, nen ep LF o day de moi
# nen tang checkout ra CUNG BYTES -> cung mot hash, khong con chuyen "2 hash cho 1 file".
*.jsonl text eol=lf

# Script shell chay tren Linux/VPS cung phai giu LF (CRLF lam hong shebang).
*.sh text eol=lf
